step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Drezel</col> to get three <col=800000>meat pie</col>s and three <col=800000>apple pie</col>s.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Leave the temple and run south through <col=800000>Mort Myre Swamp</col> to the <col=800000>Nature Grotto</col> north-west of <col=800000>Mort'ton</col>. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the temple and run south through Mort Myre Swamp to the Nature Grotto north-west of Mort'ton. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Attempt to enter the grotto and <col=800000>Filliman</col> will come out. Wear your <col=800000>amulet of ghostspeak</col> and talk to him. . Note that Filliman will disappear after a while so you need to be actively interacting with him.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the temple and run south through Mort Myre Swamp to the Nature Grotto north-west of Mort'ton. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to enter the grotto and Filliman will come out. Wear your amulet of ghostspeak and talk to him. . Note that Filliman will disappear after a while so you need to be actively interacting with him.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Take the <col=800000>washing bowl</col> off the nearby <col=800000>bench</col> to find a <col=800000>mirror</col> underneath.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the temple and run south through Mort Myre Swamp to the Nature Grotto north-west of Mort'ton. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to enter the grotto and Filliman will come out. Wear your amulet of ghostspeak and talk to him. . Note that Filliman will disappear after a while so you need to be actively interacting with him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the washing bowl off the nearby bench to find a mirror underneath.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the mirror on Filliman, he then tells you to find his <col=800000>journal</col>. If using does not work, try talking him again, it should do the trick.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the temple and run south through Mort Myre Swamp to the Nature Grotto north-west of Mort'ton. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to enter the grotto and Filliman will come out. Wear your amulet of ghostspeak and talk to him. . Note that Filliman will disappear after a while so you need to be actively interacting with him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the washing bowl off the nearby bench to find a mirror underneath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the mirror on Filliman, he then tells you to find his journal. If using does not work, try talking him again, it should do the trick.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Search (right-click) the grotto tree to get his journal then use it on him to give it to him. He'll give you a <col=800000>druidic spell</col>.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Talk to Drezel to get three meat pies and three apple pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the temple and run south through Mort Myre Swamp to the Nature Grotto north-west of Mort'ton. Note: You must enter Mort Myre through the gate, or Filliman will not appear.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to enter the grotto and Filliman will come out. Wear your amulet of ghostspeak and talk to him. . Note that Filliman will disappear after a while so you need to be actively interacting with him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the washing bowl off the nearby bench to find a mirror underneath.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the mirror on Filliman, he then tells you to find his journal. If using does not work, try talking him again, it should do the trick.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search (right-click) the grotto tree to get his journal then use it on him to give it to him. He'll give you a druidic spell.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Run back to <col=800000>Drezel</col> and ask him to bless you.</col>
