line	
line	<str>Stand on the orange stone and tell Filliman you've solved the puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the hole under the tree then search the grotto in the middle of the cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give the nature spirit your silver sickle by talking to him and he will give you a druid pouch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the grotto and stand next to rotting plants (logs, bushes, branches) in the swamp.</str>
line	
line	<str>Using the silver sickle (b)'s Bloom ability (requires prayer points), harvest the swamp plants and fill your druid pouch with them.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use your filled druid pouch on <col=800000>Ghast</col>s to make them attackable, kill three of them.</col>
